FILE: cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint/v2_read.go:166
AUTHOR: Copilot
BODY: readTranscriptFromRef returns the unsuffixed transcript file (full.jsonl) immediately when present. With this repo’s chunking convention, full.jsonl is chunk 0 and additional chunks are stored as full.jsonl.001, .002, etc., so this will return only the first chunk and silently truncate large transcripts. Consider detecting chunk entries first and reassembling all chunks (including chunk 0) instead of returning full.jsonl directly when chunk files exist.
