FILE: cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint/v2_read.go:213
AUTHOR: Copilot
BODY: readChunkedTranscriptFromTree currently (1) ignores chunk index 0 entirely (the base file full.jsonl), and (2) reassembles by raw byte concatenation. The existing chunking utilities assume chunk 0 is the base file and JSONL chunks need newline-aware reassembly (see agent.ReassembleTranscript / ReassembleJSONL). This will produce corrupted transcripts for chunked sessions.
