FILE: cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint/v2_read.go:107
AUTHOR: Copilot
BODY: ReadSessionContent discards any error from resolveTranscriptFromFull. That makes genuine failures (e.g., corrupted refs, inability to list archived generations, or missing /full refs) indistinguishable from “no transcript”, and can lead to silent fallback behavior. Consider returning the error unless it’s an expected “not found/no transcript” condition so callers can decide whether to fall back to v1 or surface the failure.
